release: hwcomposer format shim for layers the compositor can't import

Install venus/hwc-yuv's shim as /vendor/lib64/hw/hwcomposer.waydroid.so
with the vendor.img module next to it as hwcomposer.waydroid.real.so, so
YV12 video frames are composed by SurfaceFlinger instead of killing the
composer's Wayland connection. Needs Mesa patch 1007 in vulkan.virtio.so.
Applies on top of release-0002. See venus/notes-tiktok.md.

caoanhhao used AI to code
